ia","c":14},{"lap":30,"text":"The team took 10 minutes to fix the leak, threw some water on Hill, whose overalls were soaked in fuel, and sent him back out.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":15},{"lap":57,"text":"Ickx suddenly pitted on lap 57 to repair a broken fuel line, and he rejoined in twelfth place.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":3},{"lap":83,"text":"On lap 83, with its oil gone, the Cosworth engine in the Tyrrell seized, leaving Rodr\u00edguez with an 18.8 second lead over Fittipaldi, who led team-mate Reine Wisell by another 46 seconds.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":14},{"lap":101,"text":"BRM refueled the car, but Rodr\u00edguez had lost 38 seconds to Fittipaldi, who took the lead.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0}],"x":{"drivers":[{"id":366,"ref":"hutchison","name":"Gus Hutchison","code":null,"nationality":"American","dob":"1937-04-26","helmet":null,"seasons":{"1970":{"car":"brabham_1970","source":"history","skills":{"pace":[0.2356,0.5146],"quali":[0.2324,0.3737]}}}}],"cars":[{"id":"tyrrell_1970","ref":"tyrrell","name":"Tyrrell","year":1970,"pace":-0.525,"pace_sd":0.5,"deg_rel":0.0,"n_races":3,"p_mech_lap":0.00791,"colours":null,"source":"history"}]}}